{{Quote|That's right, Ben. I'm you, only even ''more'' awesome!|Ben 10,000 introducing himself to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name="Ben 10,000 Returns">''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]''</ref>}}
'''Benjamin "Ben" Kirby Tennyson''', self-nicknamed '''Ben 10,000''', was one of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]'s futures, set 20 years from '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s time frame.{{Refn|group = note|This Ben 10,000, and by extension the [[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline|timeline]] he belongs to, was the true future of Ben Prime as of ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'',<ref name=PP>[[Professor Paradox]]</ref><ref name="Ben 10,000 Returns" /> but that has since been changed as of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', with the re-introduction of the [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|original Ben 10,000]] as the current true future of Ben Prime.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW OV Future Response.png]]|group = DJW|name = img}}{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|group = BTP}} Thus, this timeline was effectively erased.{{Refn|name = erased|group = DJW}}{{Refn|name = pruned|group = DJW}}}}

==Appearance==
Ben 10,000 was rather tall, had a thick and muscular build due to the various adventures he had experienced that had left him in shape,{{Refn|[[:File:Why is Ben 10,000 muscular.png]]|group = DR}} and sports a full beard. His hair was combed left-sided, and he wore a customized skintight outfit: consisting of a dark graphite round-neck T-shirt with a custom white hourglass design in the middle. The shirt was tucked in his green pants pulled up to his waist; a belt with multiple pouches, and black calf-high boots with brown straps on them.

==Personality==
Compared to the [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] from the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', this one was much more like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]. He was cocky and laid-back for an adult, and tended to make jokes, even when fighting. He easily got full of himself and enjoys attention. However, when the situation called for it, he showed a more serious side of himself. 

He also retained some of his younger self's mischievous side. While he refused to give his younger self access to Master Control, claiming he'd get in trouble with [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]], he gave his younger self access to a few new aliens to annoy Azmuth.

==History==
===Background===
As a professional hero, Ben has had many more adventures than [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|his 16-year-old self]]. During this period, he gained more powers to show for his reputation and learned how to use some [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] in his [[Human (Classic)|human]] form from his cousin Gwen.

Ben eventually unlocked his greatest transformation: an [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] for his human form known as [[Ultimate Ben]]. After discovering this transformation, Ben 10,000 has not needed to physically transform into any of his actual alien forms for years. Though he could still turn into regular and Ultimate aliens, he preferred using Ultimate Ben for quicker access to the aliens' powers in combat.

At one point, Ben 10,000 was the President of [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] and defeated the third [[Chimera Sui Generis (Classic)|Vilgaxian]] invasion during his term in office. He was eventually succeeded by Gwen.

===Ultimate Alien===
Ben 10,000 appeared in ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', where he battled [[Eon]] and his [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|minions]] in his [[Tennyson Tower|headquarters]]. He easily defeated the minions as Ultimate Ben, but when Eon himself attempted to blast him with a time ray, Ultimate Ben countered using [[Clockwork]]'s powers and knocked him to the [[Prime Timeline|past]] of his [[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline|timeline]].

Approached by [[Professor Paradox]], Ben 10,000 realized his mistake he had made. Paradox confirmed his fears, and they arrived in the past shortly after present-day [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] used a spell on the [[Hands of Armageddon]]. As Ben 10,000 introduced himself, present-day [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] mistook him for a [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|different Ben 10,000]], before he was corrected. The quintet took the Hands of Armageddon in the [[Rustbucket 3]] as they flew out to a desert, and it summoned more of Eon's minions, which Ben 10,000 once more fought against. Using [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]]'s abilities, he helped the Rustbucket 3 make an emergency landing. Using Clockwork and [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] respectively, Ben 10,000 and Ben tried to destroy the Hands of Armageddon, in turn accidentally summoning Eon to the present.

Confronted by Eon and his minions once more, Ben 10,000 took on the latter before saving his past self from the latter. After Eon revealed himself to be an alternate version of Ben, Ben 10,000 helped Gwen and Kevin fend him off while Ben as Jetray destroyed the Hands of Armageddon. Upon its destruction, and Eon's defeat, Ben 10,000 restored his past self's transformations, in addition to adding new ones. He was soon returned to his future by Paradox.

At some point between ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'' and ''[[Ben Again]]'', Ben 10,000's timeline was erased.{{Refn|name = erased|group = DJW}}{{Refn|name = pruned|group = DJW}}

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
B10kR (30).png|Expert Martial Artistry
B10kR (21.5).png|Enhanced Reflexes
B10kR (455).png|Magic/Spell Casting
</gallery>
Ben 10,000 was incredibly skilled in hand-to-hand combat and martial arts, able to easily fend off several of [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|Eon's minions]] with no aid from his powers. 

Ben 10,000 had enhanced reflexes, as shown when he narrowly dodged being hit by [[Eon]]'s time ray.

Ben 10,000 had an enhanced eidetic memory, as he was able to remember even conversations from years ago with precise clarity.

Ben 10,000 had learned "[[Spells (Classic)|a few tricks]]" from Gwen, as shown when he, in his [[Ultimate Ben]] form, cast the Contego spell which created a magic wall made of [[manna]] to protect himself from Eon's temporal energy blast.

Ben 10,000 demonstrated a strong understanding of the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]], as he successfully restored [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], [[Swampfire]], and [[Ultimate Swampfire]] after they had been destroyed. Additionally, he unlocked several new aliens that his [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|teenage self]] had not yet accessed. He was also aware of the Master Control code; however, he refused to share it with his younger self, stating that he was already in enough trouble with [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]].

===Equipment===
[[File:B10kR (37).png|thumb|Omnitrix]]
Ben 10,000 had unlocked and mastered all the powers of the [[Omnitrix (Ultimate Alien Future)|Omnitrix]]. He could access these powers instantly and for as long as he wanted, including the [[Ultimate Forms]]. Furthermore, he could utilize pretty much all these abilities without needing to transform into the alien forms themselves; instead, he was able to do so through his own ultimate form, known as [[Ultimate Ben]].

